GX Shell (https://github.com/gx0404/gx_shell) bundles independently licensed
components. Their license texts are installed alongside them:

 - WezTerm GX, based on WezTerm (https://github.com/wezterm/wezterm), MIT License:
   /usr/share/doc/wezterm-gx/copyright
   Its bundled configuration and plugins keep their own license files under:
   /usr/share/wezterm-gx/dotfiles/
 - Oh My Zsh GX, based on Oh My Zsh (https://github.com/ohmyzsh/ohmyzsh), MIT License:
   /usr/share/doc/ohmyzsh-gx/licenses/ohmyzsh-LICENSE.txt
 - herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), Apache License 2.0, together with
   powerlevel10k, zoxide, gitstatus, JetBrains Mono Nerd Font and other bundled
   dependencies:
   /usr/share/doc/ohmyzsh-gx/licenses/
 - Zsh (https://www.zsh.org/), under its own license:
   /usr/lib/ohmyzsh-gx/share/licenses/zsh/LICENCE
 - Noto Sans CJK (https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk), copyright 2014-2019
   Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), SIL Open Font License 1.1:
   /usr/share/doc/gx-shell/NotoSansCJK-OFL-1.1.txt

Corresponding source for the redistributed components is published with every
release as gx-shell_<version>_amd64-sources.tar.xz at
https://github.com/gx0404/gx_shell/releases
